// # LSP CLI Command Interface — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Front door for the lsp command surface. Re-exports the standalone entry point that wires the LSP engine to stdio JSON-RPC.
//
// Setup: The lsp binary is one command: serve LSP over stdio (or one-shot file mode). The dispatch is just argv parsing, then the stdio loop runs until shutdown/exit/EOF.
//
// Beats:
//   1. cmd_lsp.oo parses --stdio, --file <path>, and --stdlib-root <dir> from argv.
//   2. main.oo is the package's binary entry: parse argv, call run_ooda_lsp, return Result<Int, String>.
//   3. run_ooda_lsp delegates to wire/lsp_stdio.oo::lsp_serve (stdio) or ::lsp_serve_buffer (file mode).

import "cmd_lsp.oo";
